WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,280
Why didn't you call me

2
00:00:01,280 --> 00:00:02,760
It's okay, you can just call me.

3
00:00:02,760 --> 00:00:03,920
I'll put it in for you to sleep with

4
00:00:03,920 --> 00:00:05,000
How can you sleep like this?

5
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:05,920
dirty and hard

6
00:00:05,920 --> 00:00:07,960
It was too late when I came over last night

7
00:00:07,960 --> 00:00:09,720
I said I wouldn’t bother you, so I didn’t call you.

8
00:00:09,720 --> 00:00:10,920
You really are

9
00:00:10,920 --> 00:00:12,280
Who is our relationship with whom?

10
00:00:12,280 --> 00:00:13,960
If you need anything, you can come to me directly.

11
00:00:13,960 --> 00:00:17,210
Our relationship is not comparable to others.

12
00:00:17,210 --> 00:00:18,370
Then let's go have breakfast

13
00:00:18,370 --> 00:00:22,210
Then go to the labor market to find a job.

14
00:00:22,210 --> 00:00:23,850
I thought about it all night last night

15
00:00:23,850 --> 00:00:25,810
I don’t need to go to the labor market for now.

16
00:00:25,810 --> 00:00:27,690
Anyway, I haven’t had much to do recently.

17
00:00:27,690 --> 00:00:29,290
I was thinking we should find a community

18
00:00:29,290 --> 00:00:30,730
Go and help people move

19
00:00:30,730 --> 00:00:33,090
Or what do you think about doing something else?

20
00:00:33,090 --> 00:00:34,130
But this

21
00:00:34,130 --> 00:00:35,090
It doesn't matter

22
00:00:35,090 --> 00:00:36,530
I just came to tell you this

23
00:00:36,530 --> 00:00:37,450
Just do your job

24
00:00:37,450 --> 00:00:38,930
I'll go find something to do near the community first.

25
00:00:38,930 --> 00:00:40,290
If something happens to you, there will be more

26
00:00:40,290 --> 00:00:42,290
If you can't do it, just call me.

27
00:00:42,290 --> 00:00:43,410
That's it then

28
00:00:43,410 --> 00:00:47,480
Brother, please keep an eye on your phone at all times, okay?

29
00:00:47,480 --> 00:00:49,880
Find a community and put up a sign to collect clothes

30
00:00:49,880 --> 00:00:53,580
Help with transportation by the way

31
00:00:53,580 --> 00:00:56,020
Handsome guy, how do you charge for this? It depends on your stuff.

32
00:00:56,020 --> 00:00:58,780
I have a batch of rescue clothes at home that I need to sell. Come in with me, okay?

33
00:00:58,780 --> 00:01:00,500
Just wait a minute and I'll take out the clothes.
